1342
00:48:45,266 --> 00:48:47,498
I might've found some
clues to help us out.

1343
00:48:47,498 --> 00:48:51,239
- [Tom] (laughing) You could find a clue.

1344
00:48:51,239 --> 00:48:53,668
- The hard part's telling Mr. Wheeler.

1345
00:48:53,668 --> 00:48:55,942
I sure dread that.

1346
00:48:55,942 --> 00:48:58,483
- Not like we found them there.

1347
00:48:58,483 --> 00:49:00,173
- He's sure gonna raise Ned

1348
00:49:00,173 --> 00:49:02,252
'cause I didn't find this wreck sooner.

1349
00:49:02,252 --> 00:49:04,491
- [Tom] Ned? Raise Ned?

1350
00:49:04,491 --> 00:49:06,105
- Where's Mr. Compton?

1351
00:49:06,105 --> 00:49:08,405
- Oh, he we down to the field
with a load of fuel oil.

1352
00:49:08,405 --> 00:49:09,660
Back in two or three hours.

1353
00:49:09,660 --> 00:49:11,243
I'm gonna close up.

1354
00:49:12,151 --> 00:49:13,403
- I'll see you later.

1355
00:49:13,403 --> 00:49:15,145
- [Joel] I know, I know,
that's what I'm afraid of.

1356
00:49:15,145 --> 00:49:16,776
(laughing)

1357
00:49:16,776 --> 00:49:19,236
- [Tom] Real change, folks.

1358
00:49:19,236 --> 00:49:21,673
- [Crow] It's the wages of fear.

1359
00:49:21,673 --> 00:49:24,570
- [Joel] I sing whenever
I sing whenever she sings.

1360
00:49:24,570 --> 00:49:27,044
(hiccuping)

1361
00:49:27,044 --> 00:49:28,418
(yelling)

1362
00:49:28,418 --> 00:49:29,585
- [Joel] Whoa!

1363
00:49:30,482 --> 00:49:33,301
- [Crow] Wow, the first
cool thing in the movie!

1364
00:49:33,301 --> 00:49:35,199
- [Joel] I just know I'm
gonna take the blame for this,

1365
00:49:35,199 --> 00:49:37,199
and I wasn't even close!

1366
00:49:39,148 --> 00:49:42,815
- [Tom] Meanwhile, back
that the Joad house.

1367
00:49:45,310 --> 00:49:46,143
- Hi Mom.

1368
00:49:48,032 --> 00:49:49,115
Sign a plate.

1369
00:49:50,239 --> 00:49:51,931
- Just a minute, not so fast, there.

1370
00:49:51,931 --> 00:49:53,090
- What for?

1371
00:49:53,090 --> 00:49:54,755
- [Crow] Lean right guard mom?

1372
00:49:54,755 --> 00:49:55,664
(Mom laughing)

1373
00:49:55,664 --> 00:49:56,845
