playing football with her.

1378
00:50:02,957 --> 00:50:04,208
That's wrong!

1379
00:50:04,208 --> 00:50:05,907
Crazy people.

1380
00:50:05,907 --> 00:50:07,268
- [Tom] Oedipus, you put me down.

1381
00:50:07,268 --> 00:50:09,435
You'll poke your eyes out.

1382
00:50:12,297 --> 00:50:14,253
(Tom grunting)

1383
00:50:14,253 --> 00:50:15,753
- Keep 'em closed.

1384
00:50:17,390 --> 00:50:18,723
- This is silly.

1385
00:50:21,706 --> 00:50:22,873
- [Tom] Uh oh.

1386
00:50:24,961 --> 00:50:26,543
- Look what Lisa got me.

1387
00:50:26,543 --> 00:50:27,786
Stay there, Chase.

1388
00:50:27,786 --> 00:50:28,619
Watch.

1389
00:50:29,887 --> 00:50:30,730
(Crow sniffling)

1390
00:50:30,730 --> 00:50:32,178
- [Crow] Tugging at the heartstrings.

1391
00:50:32,178 --> 00:50:33,485
This isn't fair.

1392
00:50:33,485 --> 00:50:35,378
