1393
00:50:35,378 --> 00:50:39,545
- [Joel] I thought you meant
braces on your teeth, honey.

1394
00:50:42,012 --> 00:50:43,439
- [Tom] Take 'em back, they don't work.

1395
00:50:43,439 --> 00:50:44,781
- I can get up.

1396
00:50:44,781 --> 00:50:46,995
(Crow whimpering)

1397
00:50:46,995 --> 00:50:49,245
- [Crow] This is so tender.

1398
00:50:51,871 --> 00:50:53,288
Oh, it's so cute.

1399
00:50:55,595 --> 00:50:56,825
- [Tom] I can't take it.

1400
00:50:56,825 --> 00:50:59,242
(whimpering)

1401
00:51:00,183 --> 00:51:01,600
- [Crow] Whoa, the braces
shorted out the house.

1402
00:51:01,600 --> 00:51:04,709
(whimpering)

1403
00:51:04,709 --> 00:51:08,470
- [Chase] That was wonderful,
baby, just wonderful.

1404
00:51:08,470 --> 00:51:11,507
- I've been practicing all afternoon.

1405
00:51:11,507 --> 00:51:14,227
Ever since Lisa brought the braces over.

1406
00:51:14,227 --> 00:51:16,861
And I walked all the way, twice.

1407
00:51:16,861 --> 00:51:19,300
I want to do it right for you.

1408
00:51:19,300 --> 00:51:20,506
- [Tom] Uh huh, that's neat.

1409
00:51:20,506 --> 00:51:21,884
Who's your friend?

1410
00:51:21,884 --> 00:51:24,551
- [Crow] Okay, back in the case.

1411
00:51:26,563 --> 00:51:30,730
- [Joel] Silly chatterbox,
they're on the wrong feet.

