1413
00:51:35,542 --> 00:51:36,827
- [Chase] ♫ There was a mushroom ♫

1414
00:51:36,827 --> 00:51:37,897
- [Tom] It's Raffi!

1415
00:51:37,897 --> 00:51:38,730
Here he is.
- [Chase] ♫ Sad little

1416
