♫ mushroom ♫

1417
00:51:40,560 --> 00:51:42,924
- [Joel] He really did come
with a banjo on his knee.

1418
00:51:42,924 --> 00:51:45,338
- ♫ Ready to cry

1419
00:51:45,338 --> 00:51:47,973
♫ There was a sparrow ♫

1420
00:51:47,973 --> 00:51:50,785
- [Crow] I'm gonna go
listen to my cat scream.

