00:51:50,785 --> 00:51:52,603
- [Chase] ♫ There was an eagle ♫

1422
00:51:52,603 --> 00:51:54,700
- [Tom] ♫ Who was a tow truck operator

1423
00:51:54,700 --> 00:51:56,329
