♫ Children laugh

1430
00:52:06,130 --> 00:52:10,051
♫ The Lord said laugh, laugh, laugh ♫

1431
00:52:10,051 --> 00:52:12,218
- [Crow] Ouch, tough room.

1432
00:52:13,394 --> 00:52:14,375
- [Joel] She's trying to wish him

1433
00:52:14,375 --> 00:52:17,362
into the cornfields right now.

1434
00:52:17,362 --> 00:52:20,546
- ♫ And all that is left
to complete the joy ♫

1435
00:52:20,546 --> 00:52:22,020
- [Tom] ♫ If it wasn't for the

1436
00:52:22,020 --> 00:52:23,264
- [All] ♫ blue tail fly

1437
