♫ Jimmy crack corn

1438
00:52:24,154 --> 00:52:25,692
♫ and I don't care ♫

1439
00:52:25,692 --> 00:52:26,844
- ♫ Yeah

1440
00:52:26,844 --> 00:52:28,223
♫ Yeah ♫

1441
