- ♫ And there was a garden ♫

1443
00:52:32,771 --> 00:52:34,026
- [Tom] ♫ I got a fast tow truck ♫

1444
00:52:34,026 --> 00:52:35,568
- ♫ A beautiful garden ♫

1445
00:52:35,568 --> 00:52:37,213
- [Joel] He's improvising now.

1446
00:52:37,213 --> 00:52:39,829
- ♫ Of a world without joy ♫

1447
00:52:39,829 --> 00:52:41,097
- [Crow] Thanks for cheering us up.

1448
00:52:41,097 --> 00:52:42,887
- [Chase] ♫ Then there was laughter ♫

1449
00:52:42,887 --> 00:52:43,775
- [Joel] Well, we assume that.

1450
00:52:43,775 --> 00:52:45,895
- [Chase] ♫ Wonderful laughter

1451
00:52:45,895 --> 00:52:47,709
