1452
00:52:47,709 --> 00:52:50,300
- [Tom] Boy, you know, I
just love a Sammy Cahn lyric.

1453
00:52:50,300 --> 00:52:52,787
- ♫ And the Lord said laugh

1454
00:52:52,787 --> 00:52:54,700
♫ Children laugh ♫

1455
00:52:54,700 --> 00:52:56,891
- [Joel] This is the Chapin
brother they don't talk about.

1456
