00:53:04,440 --> 00:53:05,273
into his head voice.

1462
00:53:05,273 --> 00:53:07,121
- ♫ The Lord said laugh

1463
00:53:07,121 --> 00:53:08,636
♫ Children laugh ♫

1464
00:53:08,636 --> 00:53:10,155
- [Joel] Yup, smells like teen spirit.

1465
00:53:10,155 --> 00:53:14,551
- [Tom] Take it home, brother.
- ♫ The Lord said laugh ♫

1466
00:53:14,551 --> 00:53:15,801
- [Tom] Please.

1467
00:53:16,818 --> 00:53:17,667
- ♫ Laugh ♫

1468
00:53:17,667 --> 00:53:18,741
(Crow gasping)

1469
00:53:18,741 --> 00:53:19,574
- [Crow] No, not the coda.

1470
00:53:19,574 --> 00:53:21,657
- [Crow, Tom, & Joel] No!

1471
00:53:23,278 --> 00:53:25,766
