1473
00:53:28,730 --> 00:53:30,540
- It sure is.
(Tom yelping)

1474
00:53:30,540 --> 00:53:32,728
And you know, I never felt
any more like laughing.

1475
00:53:32,728 --> 00:53:33,889
- [Crow] Thanks a lot.

1476
00:53:33,889 --> 00:53:36,080
- I didn't think you'd be able
to do that good in a week.

1477
00:53:36,080 --> 00:53:38,028
- Didn't you really?

1478
00:53:38,028 --> 00:53:38,931
- Honest.

1479
00:53:38,931 --> 00:53:41,470
But you know, you're gonna
have to work real hard.

1480
