You mustn't be disappointed.

1481
00:53:42,969 --> 00:53:44,969
Takes a long time, okay?

1482
00:53:46,331 --> 00:53:49,224
- [Crow] Now, scram, I got a dame here.

1483
00:53:49,224 --> 00:53:51,248
- It's your bedtime.

1484
00:53:51,248 --> 00:53:53,140
- Do I have to, Chase?

1485
00:53:53,140 --> 00:53:55,390
- You sure do.
- [Tom] Yup.

1486
00:53:56,508 --> 00:53:59,024
- [Chase] Show me how you can walk.

1487
00:53:59,024 --> 00:54:01,349
- [Crow] Get out before
he starts playing again.

1488
00:54:01,349 --> 00:54:02,377
- Good night, Lisa.

1489
00:54:02,377 --> 00:54:05,223
- [Tom] Little grand-stander, you.

1490
00:54:05,223 --> 00:54:06,800
You gotta love her.

1491
00:54:06,800 --> 00:54:10,217
- [Joel] Don't ever sing that song again.

1492
00:54:12,443 --> 00:54:15,302
- That was a wonderful
thing for you to do, Lisa.

1493
00:54:15,302 --> 00:54:16,469
