1496
00:54:20,590 --> 00:54:22,158
- I was gonna pick 'em up in the morning.

1497
00:54:22,158 --> 00:54:23,032
- I know.

1498
00:54:23,032 --> 00:54:24,031
When you showed me that money,

1499
