- Hello.

1808
01:05:43,032 --> 01:05:45,052
Yeah, hello Sheriff.

1809
01:05:45,052 --> 01:05:45,885
The what?

1810
01:05:47,369 --> 01:05:48,766
Book on reptiles?
- [Joel] Sheriff,

1811
01:05:48,766 --> 01:05:51,016
you're breathin' all funny.

1812
01:05:52,900 --> 01:05:53,944
- Yeah, sure.

1813
01:05:53,944 --> 01:05:54,904
