1827
01:06:24,261 --> 01:06:25,505
- [Joel] I got the problem, too.

1828
01:06:25,505 --> 01:06:28,728
- Makes either runts
or giants out of them.

1829
01:06:28,728 --> 01:06:30,484
- Good, but, what's that mean to me?

1830
01:06:30,484 --> 01:06:32,727
- [Crow] Trouble.

1831
01:06:32,727 --> 01:06:36,509
