1892
01:08:39,636 --> 01:08:42,436
I just thought you'd wanna know.

1893
01:08:42,436 --> 01:08:43,754
- Then, we'd better warn everybody.

1894
01:08:43,754 --> 01:08:44,948
- No.

1895
01:08:44,948 --> 01:08:47,931
- [Tom] That would be tellin'.

1896
01:08:47,931 --> 01:08:50,796
