1910
01:09:18,946 --> 01:09:23,113
♫ Doin' the butt ♫

1911
01:09:32,334 --> 01:09:34,834
(Tom singing)

1912
01:09:38,186 --> 01:09:39,043
- Well, hello.

1913
01:09:39,043 --> 01:09:40,309
I'm so glad you could join me.

1914
01:09:40,309 --> 01:09:42,064
I'm your host, Thomas Servo,

1915
01:09:42,064 --> 01:09:44,241
and this is Servo on Cinema.

1916
