1989
01:12:15,860 --> 01:12:17,319
I want you to have a ball tonight.

1990
01:12:17,319 --> 01:12:20,345
Let's begin with one of
the top KILT survey stars.

1991
01:12:20,345 --> 01:12:22,029
What do you say, now,
let's everybody dance.

1992
01:12:22,029 --> 01:12:24,012
(upbeat music)

1993
01:12:24,012 --> 01:12:28,179
- [Tom] This guy really
earns his salary, doesn't he?

1994
01:12:30,759 --> 01:12:34,926
- [Crow] ♫ Shake, shake,
shake your forbidden parts ♫

1995
01:12:36,867 --> 01:12:38,662
- [Tom] ♫ Shake those forbidden parts ♫

1996
